| --- | --- |
| id<br>required | string<uuid><br>Example:f0cc58cb-3b71-42c7-b28b-aeed4aa0493f<br>Id of Expense to update |
| status<br>required | string<br>Enum:"DRAFT""DONE"<br>Example:DONE<br>Expense status to update to |

### Responses

