Payment that needs to be added for the selected bank account

|     |     |
| --- | --- |
| instructed\_amount<br>required | object (BankPaymentAmount) |
| recipient<br>required | object (BankPaymentRecipient) |
| iban<br>required | string<= 50 characters<br>The IBAN of the bank account |
